7592186446873 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the differential $\\text{d}f$ for the function $f(x,y,z)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xyz).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446873 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "26a471f3-9b78-5070-a5db-c0478cd96f7d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446873 #edb/ref 1074 "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y,z) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y+(\\frac{∂f}{∂z})\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =\\frac{yz\\,\\text{d}x}{xyz}+\\frac{xz\\,\\text{d}y}{xyz}+\\frac{xy\\,\\text{d}z}{xyz} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\,\\text{d}x}{x}+\\frac{\\,\\text{d}y}{y}+\\frac{\\,\\text{d}z}{z}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1069 "q-79748" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1071 "Given a rectangular solid, find the differential $\\text{d}S$ for the surface area $S$ of the rectangular solid if the lengths of the sides are $a=4,$ $b=5,$ and $c=7.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "4e75bdad-f36e-527c-a1e9-527d230dfe09" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446874 #edb/ref 1074 "The  surface area of the rectangular solid is $S=2ab+2bc+2ac.$ Let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(a,b,c) & =(\\frac{∂S}{∂a})\\,\\text{d}a+(\\frac{∂S}{∂b})\\,\\text{d}b+(\\frac{∂S}{∂c})\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =2(b+c)\\,\\text{d}a+2(a+c)\\,\\text{d}b+2(a+b)\\,\\text{d}c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $a=4,$ $b=5,$ and $c=7,$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(4,5,7) & =2(5+7)\\,\\text{d}a+2(4+7)\\,\\text{d}b+2(4+5)\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =24\\,\\text{d}a+22\\,\\text{d}b+18\\,\\text{d}c.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
